-- the pencil (H, S) as integers, and the search for its lowest level in units of 2^−20, outside every proof:
-- n halvings of [lo, hi] by whether the witness certifies no level below the middle
fk-prob : FkT → List (List Nat) → (List (List BZ) × BZ) × (List (List BZ) × BZ)
fk-prob t sts = (he-int (fk-hm t sts) , he-int (fk-sm t sts))
